  "slug": "who-hash",
  "name": "Who-Hash",
  "recipe_type": "breakfast",
  "brief_description": "This Who-hash recipe is ideal for camping breakfasts thanks to the use of canned fully cooked luncheon meat and canned potatoes.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Heat oil in a nonstick skillet over medium heat. Spread potatoes and meat in a single layer in the skillet; cook until browned on the bottom, about 5 minutes. Turn potatoes and meat; cook until the other side is browned, about 5 minutes. Add onion; cook and stir until tender, 5 to 7 minutes."
    }
  ],
